    described the geometry backend as PicoGK — LMCAD is the geometry authority
    for this code now;
  * the `_DEFAULT_KERNEL` fallback in `sampling.py`, which was an absolute path
    into a developer's LMCAD checkout and is now relative to this repository.

The numerics are untouched.


